  "notes": "Variation with revised cover with blurb at bottom-right saying: \"Includes California Dreamin' - Monday Monday - I Call Your Name\"\r\n\r\nFirst pressings had no song titles on cover with a toilet fully visible to right of the bathtub and are referred to as the \"Toilet Cover\".\r\n\r\nAnother revised version exists with just \"Includes California Dreamin'\" blurb covering toilet.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.discogs.com/release/5395876\r\n\r\nCover does NOT have RIAA Gold Record Award seal [later pressings have this].\r\n\r\nCat # D-50006 appears on the label and spine.\r\nCat # D50006 appears on the rear cover top-left.",
